        "r": 318.59230000000014,
        "b": 326.2840000000001
      },
      "content": "Verify that the OSCi drain valves (4) are closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0506",
      "reading_order": 777,
      "section": "4.3    Putting into operation (commissioning)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 319.321,
        "r": 552.4864000000009,
        "b": 307.144
      },
      "content": "Unscrew the clamping ring (1) of the cover of the first vessel of the OSCi and take off the cover (2)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0507",
      "reading_order": 778,
      "section": "4.3    Putting into operation (commissioning)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 300.18100000000004,
        "r": 554.8139999999992,
        "b": 274.8040000000001
      },
      "content": "Take out the CDROM and the box (3) with the test bottle and the reference bottle and keep them in a safe place nearby the compressor."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0508",
      "reading_order": 779,
      "section": "4.3    Putting into operation (commissioning)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 267.7805000000001,
        "r": 554.1374999999991,
        "b": 229.20350000000008
      },
      "content": "Take the ISO 7-R ½ connection and the G ¼ ball valve with seal and screw them into the corresponding threads in the drain plate at the bottom left of the compressor front panel (Drain plate). Close the condensate sample valve."
    },
